WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.340
- It's big news that Bill

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:03.640
and Melinda Gates are getting a divorce,

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.720
especially because the
couple does not appear

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:06.800
to have a prenup.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.130
But the thing that I kept seeing

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.180
in all of the news articles reporting

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.330
on this divorce is that
Melinda Gates in filing

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:13.640
for the divorce said

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:16.550
that their marriage was
irretrievably broken.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:19.370
Tons of people have
locked onto that language

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:20.650
but I'm sorry to report that

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:23.110
that is just simply the
standard for a no fault divorce

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:24.150
in the state of Washington

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:25.385
where they are filing for divorce.

00:00:25.385 --> 00:00:27.418
To get a no fault divorce in Washington,

00:00:27.418 --> 00:00:30.264
one of the parties has to
allege that the marriage

00:00:30.264 --> 00:00:32.440
or domestic partnership is quote,

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:33.563
irretrievably broken.

00:00:33.563 --> 00:00:35.010
That's just simply the law.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.220
It's not salacious in any way.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:38.331
That's just simply what you
have to allege to get a divorce.

00:00:38.331 --> 00:00:40.061
So, sorry for those looking for drama

00:00:40.061 --> 00:00:42.753
that's just the law and
I'll see you in court.

